Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: iGhostty
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Ghostty-powered terminal for jailbroken iOS
 Terminal emulator built on libghostty's terminal core with a host-managed
 I/O backend. Packaged for both roothide and rootless bootstraps; the
 architecture field says which build this is.
 .
 Shells are spawned by the bundled ighosttyd daemon and survive app
 relaunches; SSH transport is planned on the same transport interface.
